        <!-- =================================================================== -->
        <!-- CONTAINER 2: VIRTUAL GRAPH DIGITAL TWIN LAYER                       -->
        <!-- =================================================================== -->
        <mxCell id="c2" value="2. Virtual Graph Digital Twin Layer (On-Premises OT Edge Mirror)" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#9A3412;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=3;dashed=1;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="75" width="760" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Dynamic Admittance Graph Mirror -->
        <mxCell id="vgraph" value="&lt;b&gt;Spatial Admittance Graph Mirror: G = (V, E, X, E_attr)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• Nodes: Substations V = {1...N} with 4D Features x_i = [V_i, θ_i, P_i, Q_i]^T ∈ ℝ^(N×4)&#10;• Edges: Branches E with Complex Admittance Attributes: Y_bus = G_bus + j B_bus&#10;• Dynamic Outage Invariance: Real-time Breaker State Mirroring for N-1 Contingencies" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#F97316;fontStyle=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#7C2D12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="c2">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="45" width="710" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Formal State Synchronization & Rolling Baseline -->
        <mxCell id="sync_math" value="&lt;b&gt;Formal State-Space Synchronization &amp; Rolling Baseline Filter&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• State Update:  x_DT(t_k) = x_DT(t_k-1) + K_sync · [ z_SCADA(t_k) - h(x_DT(t_k-1)) ]  with Kalman Gain K_sync = (H^T R^-1 H + P^-1)^-1 H^T R^-1&#10;• Rolling Nominal Baseline:  z_baseline(t_k) = 0.95 · z_baseline(t_k-1) + 0.05 · z_clean(t_k)  (Ablation: -16.32 pp Loc. F1 without baseline)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#EF4444;fontStyle=0;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#7F1D1D;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="c2">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="128" width="710" height="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Admittance-Conditioned GraphSAGE Backbone -->
        <mxCell id="sage_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Admittance-Conditioned GraphSAGE Backbone (3 Stacked Layers, dh = 64)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• Message Passing:  m_uv^(k) = ReLU( W_e · [ h_u^(k-1) || G_uv || B_uv ] )  (Directly Embeds Ohm's &amp; Kirchhoff's Laws)&#10;• Admittance-Weighted Aggregation:  h_v^(k) = ReLU( W_k · [ h_v^(k-1) || ∑_(u∈N(v)) ( |Y_uv| / ∑|Y_vw| ) · m_uv^(k) ] )&#10;• Target-Node Concatenation: Retains local bus variance, preventing over-smoothing in dense substation clusters" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontStyle=0;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#14532D;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="c2">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="210" width="480" height="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Privacy Badge -->
